    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let us examine the conversation line by line.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "max",
      "t": "Ладно, мы разберёмся с этим.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Alright, we will figure this out.' Max tries to calm the situation. He promises they will figure this out together.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "max",
      "t": "Всё будет хорошо.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Everything will be fine.' He offers a general reassurance. Max insists that everything will be fine in the end.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "ilya",
      "t": "Что нам делать сейчас?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'What should we do now?' Ilya is confused about their next steps. He asks what they should do right now.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "max",
      "t": "Поехали.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Let's go.' Max gives a simple command. He tells everyone it is time to go.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "sasha",
      "t": "Куда мы едем?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Where are we going?' Sasha is still confused by the instruction. She asks where exactly they are going.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "max",
      "t": "Мы никуда не едем.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'We are not going anywhere.' Max clarifies his statement. He explains they are not literally going anywhere.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "max",
      "t": "Это значит, что мы начинаем.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'It means that we are starting.' He explains the metaphor. Max says it just means they are starting the work.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "ilya",
      "t": "Теперь я всё понял.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Now I understand everything.' Ilya finally grasps the concept. He announces that he understands everything now.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "sasha",
      "t": "Тогда давайте работать.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Then let's work.' Sasha is ready to begin. She suggests they start working immediately.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "max",
      "t": "Да, за работу.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Yes, back to work.' Max agrees with her enthusiasm. He echoes her call to get back to work.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "ilya",
      "t": "У нас мало времени.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'We have little time.' Ilya points out the urgency of their task. He reminds everyone they have very little time left.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "sasha",
      "t": "Мы должны успеть.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'We must be in time.' Sasha emphasizes the goal. She says they absolutely must be in time.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "max",
      "t": "Конечно мы успеем.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Of course we will be in time.' Max projects total confidence. He assures them that they will certainly make it.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "ilya",
      "t": "Тогда начинаем прямо сейчас.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
